{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1787596842,"idle_time_limit":1.5,"command":"./hack/showcase.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/bash"}}
[0.278, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 1/7  Defaulting — the webhook completes a minimal spec\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33mSubmitting only an image and a port, with autoscaling enabled:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.127, "o", "\u001b[0;33mWhat was actually stored:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.141, "o", "  replicas:     1\r\n  cpu request:  100m\r\n  managed-by:   webapp-operator\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[0;33mNeither replicas nor the CPU request was sent — the defaulting webhook added\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33mboth. Without that request the HPA could never compute utilization at all.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.002, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 2/7  One resource in, a full stack out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.326, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get webapp,deployment,service,hpa --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.131, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com/shop-api   nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.27-alpine   1     True   12s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "deployment.apps/shop-api-deployment   1/1   1     1     12s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "service/shop-api-service   ClusterIP   10.96.10.211   <none>   8080/TCP   12s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "horizontalpodautoscaler.autoscaling/shop-api-autoscaler   Deployment/shop-api-deployment   cpu: <unknown>/50%   2     8     0     12s\r\n"]
[1.004, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 3/7  Drift correction — a manual edit to a managed field is reverted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33mSomeone patches the running Deployment by hand, bypassing the WebApp:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl set image deployment/shop-api-deployment webapp=nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.26-alpine\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.128, "o", "deployment.apps/shop-api-deployment image updated\r\n"]
[0.008, "o", "\u001b[0;33mThe desired state still says otherwise, so the next reconcile corrects it:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.160, "o", "  edit applied:  nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.26-alpine\r\n  image now:     nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.27-alpine\r\n\u001b[0;33mLevel-based reconciliation: the operator compares against the spec, so it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;33mdoes not matter who changed what, or whether it saw the change happen.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 4/7  Self-healing — delete what the operator owns\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl delete deployment/shop-api-deployment service/shop-api-service\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.132, "o", "deployment.apps \"shop-api-deployment\" deleted from showcase namespace\r\n"]
[0.027, "o", "service \"shop-api-service\" deleted from showcase namespace\r\n"]
[0.204, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get deployment,service --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.120, "o", "deployment.apps/shop-api-deployment   0/1   1     0     0s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "service/shop-api-service   ClusterIP   10.96.163.88   <none>   8080/TCP   0s\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[0;33mBoth were recreated without anyone touching the WebApp.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 5/7  Honest status — a broken image is reported, not hidden\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl patch webapp shop-api --type=merge -p {\"spec\":{\"image\":\"does-not-exist.invalid/nope:1.0\"}}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.138, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com/shop-api patched\r\n"]
[0.287, "o", "  Degraded=False (ReconcileSucceeded) all managed resources reconciled\r\n  Available=False (DeploymentNotReady) 0/3 replicas ready\r\n  Progressing=True (RolloutInProgress) 1/3 replicas updated and ready\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[0;33mRolling back to a good image:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl patch webapp shop-api --type=merge -p {\"spec\":{\"image\":\"nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.27-alpine\"}}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.130, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com/shop-api patched\r\n"]
[10.566, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get webapp shop-api\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.147, "o", "NAME       IMAGE                                     READY   AVAILABLE   AGE\r\nshop-api   nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.27-alpine   2       True        29s\r\n"]
[1.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 6/7  Admission control — four kinds of invalid input\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# mutable tag — rejected by the validating webhook\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.126, "o", "  Error from server (Forbidden): error when creating \"STDIN\": admission webhook \"vwebapp-v1.kb.io\"\r\n  denied the request: spec.image \"nginx:latest\" uses the mutable \"latest\" tag; pin an explicit\r\n  version for reproducibility\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# port out of range — rejected by the OpenAPI schema\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.149, "o", "  The WebApp \"rejected\" is invalid: spec.port: Invalid value: 70000: spec.port in body should be\r\n  less than or equal to 65535\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# maxReplicas < minReplicas — rejected by a CEL rule\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.144, "o", "  The WebApp \"rejected\" is invalid: spec.autoscaling: Invalid value: maxReplicas must be greater\r\n  than or equal to minReplicas\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[0;90m# both PDB fields set — rejected by a CEL rule\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.125, "o", "  The WebApp \"rejected\" is invalid: spec.podDisruptionBudget: Invalid value: exactly one of\r\n  minAvailable or maxUnavailable must be set\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;33mNone of these objects was ever stored.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.002, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 7/7  Cascade delete — one delete, nothing left behind\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get deployment,service,hpa --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.120, "o", "deployment.apps/shop-api-deployment   2/2   2     2     18s\r\nservice/shop-api-service   ClusterIP   10.96.163.88   <none>   8080/TCP   18s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "horizontalpodautoscaler.autoscaling/shop-api-autoscaler   Deployment/shop-api-deployment   cpu: <unknown>/50%   2     8     1     32s\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl delete webapp shop-api\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.113, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com \"shop-api\" deleted from showcase namespace\r\n"]
[0.139, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get deployment,service,hpa --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.144, "o", "No resources found in showcase namespace.\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[0;33mOwner references let Kubernetes garbage-collect the whole stack.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.127, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32m✔ Showcase complete.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.111, "x", "0"]
